{"unit_id":"Ruszero01__dsh-tang-governance#card-zh","repo":"Ruszero01/dsh-tang-governance","commit":"3ffa7c3d743062c22713cf131016ce8abb5790d5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"三省六部治理插件是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的多智能体开发治理模式。它通过 Harness preset 注册工作流工具，并在会话中展示部门架构、进度时间线、审批和执行记录。主要功能包括需求澄清、独立方案审议、用户审批门、按职责域调度六部执行、最终验收与结案确认，还可分别设置三省模型路由并记录案卷。适合希望把复杂编码需求拆成可审议、可追踪阶段的 DSH 用户。需要兼容的 DeepSeek Harness 0.1.x 与 Node.js；不需额外服务或密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:55-71","src/tool.ts:1689-1714","src/client/index.tsx:1741-1756"]}
{"unit_id":"Ruszero01__dsh-tang-governance#card-en","repo":"Ruszero01/dsh-tang-governance","commit":"3ffa7c3d743062c22713cf131016ce8abb5790d5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Tang Governance adds a multi-agent workflow to DeepSeek Harness Web. It shows progress, approvals, and execution records as agents clarify and review requirements, get user approval, delegate work, verify results, and request case closure. For complex DSH coding tasks; requires Harness and Node.js.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:55-71","src/tool.ts:1689-1714","src/client/index.tsx:1741-1756"]}
{"unit_id":"Ruszero01__dsh-tang-governance#feature-1","repo":"Ruszero01/dsh-tang-governance","commit":"3ffa7c3d743062c22713cf131016ce8abb5790d5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"三省六部治理插件的功能「分工委派」：协调器可启动三省部门 Agent，尚书省可按已登记的职责分派六部任务，并检查分派计划、角色和依赖。触发方式是治理流程中的工具调用，输入部门、任务说明和提示，产出可继续对话的子 Agent。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tool.ts:2220-2267"]}
{"unit_id":"Ruszero01__dsh-tang-governance#feature-2","repo":"Ruszero01/dsh-tang-governance","commit":"3ffa7c3d743062c22713cf131016ce8abb5790d5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"三省六部治理插件的功能「用户审批与结案」：流程在执行前提交方案供用户批准，并在验收后提交完整报告等待确认或驳回。通过对应审批工具交互，输入 Markdown 方案或报告，产出明确的批准、驳回或结案结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tool.ts:2060-2112","src/tool.ts:2112-2164"]}
